</style></div><div data-animation="default" class="nav-component w-nav" data-easing2="ease" fs-scrolldisable-element="smart-nav" data-easing="ease" data-collapse="medium" data-w-id="4915b628-02c1-4f17-6047-ab1ee6164247" role="banner" data-duration="400"><div class="nav-container"><a href="/" id="w-node-_4915b628-02c1-4f17-6047-ab1ee6164249-e6164247" aria-current="page" class="nav-logo-link w-nav-brand w--current"><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d7e82c3b46017f5c46cf_CIRR%20(1)b.png" alt="" class="nav-logo"/></a><div id="w-node-_4915b628-02c1-4f17-6047-ab1ee616424b-e6164247" class="nav-menu-wrapper"><div class="nav-menu-cart-wrapper"><nav role="navigation" class="nav-menu is-page-height-tablet w-nav-menu"><a href="/" aria-current="page" class="nav-link w-nav-link w--current">Home</a><a href="/our-standards" class="nav-link w-nav-link">Our standards</a><a href="/schooldata" class="nav-link w-nav-link">School data</a><a href="/for-students" class="nav-link w-nav-link">For students</a><a href="/for-schools" class="nav-link w-nav-link">For schools</a><a href="/about" class="nav-link w-nav-link">About us</a></nav></div></div><div id="w-node-_4915b628-02c1-4f17-6047-ab1ee61642e6-e6164247"><div class="hide-tablet"><a data-wf--button--variant="base-small" href="mailto:info@cirr.org" class="button w-variant-343a88a6-e1af-e18c-75e9-96d6e25ddbe9 w-inline-block"><div>Get in touch</div></a></div><div class="nav-menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="menu-icon"><div class="menu-icon-line-top"></div><div class="menu-icon-line-middle"><div class="menu-icon-line-middle-inner"></div></div><div class="menu-icon-line-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div><main class="main-wrapper"><section class="section-home-hero-v1"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="home-hero-grid-v1"><div data-w-id="08cf2f95-be42-48df-66dd-cfd47746518c" style="opacity:0"><div class="max-width-medium"><h1 class="heading-style-h1">Your future.<br/>Your investment.<br/>‍<span class="text-span">Your right to know.</span></h1></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="max-width-medium"><p class="text-size-medium">Before investing your time and money in education, you deserve complete transparency about outcomes.</p></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/schooldata" class="button is-white w-inline-block"><div>See our reports</div></a><a data-wf--button--variant="secondary" href="mailto:info@cirr.org" class="button w-variant-b090402a-55bc-a88c-0b0b-a52edf23a4ff w-inline-block"><div>Get in touch</div></a></div></div><div data-w-id="66dec92c-2aeb-602f-226d-ce8a33732375" style="opacity:0" class="home-hero-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdcf38a8874042e4a5db9_home_00.jpg" loading="eager" alt="" class="home-hero-image"/><div class="image-overlay"></div><div class="overlay-card"><h3 class="text-size-large is-white">Get verified data on:</h3><div class="div-block-2"><div class="div-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5e90db3452df31bbda9fe_checkmark.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><p class="text-size-medium">Graduation rates</p></div><div class="div-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5e90db3452df31bbda9fe_checkmark.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><p class="text-size-medium">Career placement success</p></div><div class="div-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5e90db3452df31bbda9fe_checkmark.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><p class="text-size-medium">Real salary outcomes</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-logos"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div data-w-id="3a605973-3e46-bcf9-e1b0-bea1b75a0d0f" style="opacity:0" class="logos-mega-wrap"><div>Trusted by world’s best companies</div><div data-w-id="93fd9c62-a81d-43c7-0fcb-e55eb8dd941a" class="logos-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93058_sl-l1.svg" alt="" class="logo-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93059_sl-l2.svg" alt="" style="opacity:0" data-w-id="2866223c-efa9-3dc9-2db5-98eb0cd6aa5c" class="logo-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93057_sl-l3.svg" alt="" style="opacity:0" data-w-id="64b9338d-aa7d-ecc1-125a-5b10d6735adc" class="logo-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b9305b_sl-l4.svg" alt="" style="opacity:0" data-w-id="ac7e8227-09d7-0f74-6fab-0c85e66d808e" class="logo-image"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b9305a_sl-l5.svg" alt="" style="opacity:0" data-w-id="5cf9bf71-79c7-63e0-b6d8-07b353486b1a" class="logo-image"/></div></div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div></div></div></section><section class="section-wwa-v1"><div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large"><div class="wwa-top-grid-v1"><div class="wwa-image-wrap-v1"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdcf35ea69f54bb5debb6_gome_02.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="wwa-top-image-v1"/><div class="image-overlay max-27rem"></div></div><div class="wwa-top-content"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">The gold standard for outcomes</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><p>The Council on Integrity in Results Reporting (CIRR) is the gold standard for transparent education outcomes. We empower students with verified, comprehensive data about graduation rates, job placement, and salaries - because your educational investment deserves nothing less.<br/><span><strong class="bold-text"><br/>What makes CIRR different?</strong></span><br/>Our members commit to reporting 100% of student outcomes. No selective reporting. No hidden numbers. Just clear, verified data you can trust.</p></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/our-standards" class="button is-white w-inline-block"><div>Check our standards</div></a></div></div></div><div class="wwa-stats-grid-v1"><div data-w-id="7a258a98-29bc-416b-128c-371f94e164c5" style="opacity:0" class="wwa-stats-card-v1"><div class="wwa-stats-number">10<span class="text-size-large">+</span></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Years of experience</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Decades of expertise powering your success.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="8e9377cc-ac80-498e-c07a-61f70fe9e810" style="opacity:0" class="wwa-stats-card-v1"><div class="wwa-stats-number">150<span class="text-size-large">+</span></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Projects successful</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Proven track record of achieving business goals.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="d70e2582-a408-41a3-1c6b-fccf1e710ceb" style="opacity:0" class="wwa-stats-card-v1"><div class="wwa-stats-number">98<span class="text-size-large">%</span></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Client satisfaction rate</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Our clients trust us to deliver excellence for their projects.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="3008d20a-30eb-b1a4-6375-46c01bce11f8" style="opacity:0" class="wwa-stats-card-v1 last"><div class="wwa-stats-number">25<span class="text-size-large">+</span></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Industries served</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Broad experience across diverse markets.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-expertise-v1"><div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large"><div data-w-id="cd22e36b-fb2f-ef70-f4ec-2d2f14539b63" style="opacity:0" class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-medium-large align-center"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Our core values</h2></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="max-width-medium align-center"><p>The foundation of our commitment to empowering students and schools through transparency, accountability, and actionable data.</p></div></div><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="expertise-grid-v1"><div id="w-node-d2c149ff-cdd2-d5ba-068d-41975eb1d01a-59b930d0" data-w-id="d2c149ff-cdd2-d5ba-068d-41975eb1d01a" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c763fe961dec2a8b887c07_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%208.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">01</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Student-first</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Your success drives everything we do. Every standard we set puts student interests first.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="cfffcc8d-8ed0-397e-c5e2-b71e8144c6b4" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c7640050f91773f02843e8_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%2027.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">02</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Actionable</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Data that empowers better decisions for students and schools alike.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="99b70149-3680-48f5-2cd0-42dbdd749fff" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c7640099d55b6a20daa66e_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%2032.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">03</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Transparent</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Complete visibility into school performance.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="cd397374-a2b7-9a7a-7c1d-246198a2fb62" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c763fd9fad9ed734024f6d_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%2012.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">04</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Verifiable</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Every data point is independently audited for accuracy</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="ff3fd354-eb49-1c58-011d-be6aec7f2752" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c76400ccb0c8abb0f1d696_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%2042.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">05</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Measurable</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Clear metrics - graduation rates, job placement, and earning potential.</p></div></div></div><div data-w-id="a67a174d-7d8e-c74b-9b0e-808655b8e7ac" style="opacity:0" class="expertise-card-v1"><div class="expertise-card-top-v1"><div class="expertise-card-icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c763fd4a70663ad9769387_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%207.svg" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium-small"/></div><div class="expertise-card-number">06</div></div><div><h3 class="text-size-large">Clear</h3><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p>Simple, straightforward reporting that anyone can understand.</p></div></div></div><a id="w-node-b4bb3e41-eb79-f30e-d855-d11614398e30-59b930d0" href="/schooldata" class="button is-white w-inline-block"><div>Check our reports</div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="section-testimonials-v3"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="cross" class="testimonial-slider-v3 w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-w-id="4751a847-d885-2353-0390-09d6047a7c78" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="testimonial-mask-v3 w-slider-mask"><div class="testimonial-slide-v3 w-slide"><div class="testimonial-card-v3"><div class="testimonial-image-wrapper-v3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5dbace355b975b81823b5_pexels-buro-millennial-636760-1438081.jpg" class="testimonial-image-v3"/></div><div class="testimonial-card-content-v3"><div><div><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium text-color-secondary"><em class="text-size-small">Early on in my search for a software engineering program to attend, I spoke with an admissions counselor at a fairly well-known coding bootcamp and inquired about their graduate&#x27;s job placement and salary outcomes. I was told that the school does not disclose its graduates&#x27; outcomes. Frustrated at being left in the dark on a key piece of information I needed to make a decision, I conducted my own research. I searched LinkedIn, Reddit, and anywhere on the internet where I could find a student testimony. After hours of research, I gathered enough data and decided against continuing with that bootcamp.</em></p></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div><p class="text-size-small"><em>Seeking transparency with bootcamps at the outset moving forward, I looked for those who disclosed their graduate outcomes and discovered CIRR. The CIRR reports presented all the data I needed to know to feel confident about selecting a bootcamp. Ultimately, I chose my software engineering program based on the data from CIRR and the program&#x27;s rigorous admissions process.</em></p></div></div><div><div>Megal Khabalt</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Technical Support Enginner @ Worldpay</div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary is-lighter">attended Codesmith Software Engineering Immersive Full-Time</div></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide-v3 w-slide"><div class="testimonial-card-v3"><div class="testimonial-image-wrapper-v3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93095_ronny-sison-4lnzxFIgTmg-unsplash.avif" class="testimonial-image-v3"/></div><div class="testimonial-card-content-v3"><div><div><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">35% increase in web traffic and a significant boost in customer inquiries within the first three months!</p></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div><p class="text-size-medium">“The team at Innovia transformed our online presence. Thanks to their tailored strategies, we saw a 35% increase in web traffic and a significant boost in customer inquiries within the first three months!”</p></div></div><div><div>Sarah Mitchell</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">CEO of SwiftMart</div></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide-v3 w-slide"><div class="testimonial-card-v3"><div class="testimonial-image-wrapper-v3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93096_jurica-koletic-7YVZYZeITc8-unsplash.avif" class="testimonial-image-v3"/></div><div class="testimonial-card-content-v3"><div><div><p class="text-size-large text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">40% boost in conversion rates and exceptional growth in qualified leads within the first three months!</p></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall hide-mobile-landscape"></div><div><p class="text-size-medium">&quot;The experts at Innovia revolutionized our digital marketing approach. Through their strategic expertise, we witnessed a 40% boost in conversion rates and growth in qualified leads within the first three months!&quot;</p></div></div><div><div>Michael Rodriguez</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">CEO of TechFlow Solutions</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonials-slider-arrow left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93090_arrow-left%20(4).svg" class="slider-arrow-icon"/></div><div class="testimonials-slider-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93090_arrow-left%20(4).svg" class="slider-arrow-icon rotate"/></div><div class="hide w-slider-nav w-round w-num"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-testimonials-v1"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="flex-space-center"><div data-w-id="7a3a840f-9ea5-c193-dfd7-77d5f66e9fde"><h2 class="heading">Real voices. Real impact.</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><p>How graduates used CIRR’s verified reports to choose the right program and invest in their futures with confidence.</p></div></div><div data-w-id="7a3a840f-9ea5-c193-dfd7-77d5f66e9fe6" class="review-mega-wrap"><div class="review-wrap"><div class="review-score">4.9</div><div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93064_stars.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div><div class="text-size-regular">Score on TrustPilot</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="119ec127-11e5-1635-4579-c86ea9621598" class="carousel-container"><div class="logo-container"><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd793816f2691018bee6_67cec7a4f47c8a1eee16924c_Testimonial%20-%20Megan%20Kabat%20-%20Codesmith.png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Megan Kaba</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Codesmith (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">Seeking transparency with bootcamps at the outset moving forward, I looked for those who disclosed their graduate outcomes and discovered CIRR. The CIRR reports presented all the data I needed to know to feel confident about selecting a bootcamp. Ultimately, I chose my software engineering program based on the data from CIRR and the program&#x27;s rigorous admissions process.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Achmad R.</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hacktiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">I believe CIRR has a considerable impact, as Hacktiv8 remains competitive despite increasing market competition. Providing transparent graduation data is essential, especially for a long-standing coding bootcamp like Hacktiv8. Transparency is key to maintaining credibility and standing out in the industry. Among the CIRR data points, I find the time it takes for graduates to secure jobs to be the most critical, as fresh graduates and career switchers need to know how soon they can gain work experience. If someone is considering a bootcamp, I would definitely recommend Hacktiv8, as it has had a positive impact on my career so far.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdeba9b90fb8eb3b83835_67cec7a4e9d311047dc4b1c8_Testimonial%20-%20Jonathan%20Zayas_Code%20Platoon.png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Jonathan Zayas</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">Being able to see the placement outcomes of coding bootcamps had a strong impact on my decision. Code Platoon’s commitment to transparency, particularly through reporting their outcomes to CIRR, gave me confidence in their ability to support graduates in finding jobs. Seeing clear data on employment rates and salaries helped me compare programs objectively and ultimately reinforced my decision to choose Code Platoon.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdea1d8b5d76c37ac859c_67cec7a4d460f904cf7aff84_Testimonial%20-%20Andrew%20Wicker%20-%20Codesmith.png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Andrew Wicker</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Codesmith (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">The CIRR reports gave me the assurance that I wasn&#x27;t just buying into promises and marketing but investing in a program that had a proven track record. After graduating from Codesmith, and landing a position with a software company leading their field, I&#x27;m grateful that I was able to find and review the information provided through CIRR. Perhaps more importantly, I&#x27;m grateful I was able to rely on it.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Ninda R.</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hacktiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">The transparency in CIRR’s graduate outcomes report significantly influenced my decision to enroll. Having access to verified placement data provided me with confidence in the program. The key factors I considered were the placement rate and the time it took for graduates to secure jobs. Since the average time was around three months, it reassured me before joining. CIRR data is an important consideration for any bootcamp, as it helps prospective students make informed decisions.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67d97dc4f2eed921b54b4535_Testimonial%20-%20Nick%20Smith%20-%20Code%20Platoon.jpeg" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Nick Smith</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">When I was looking into various coding bootcamps, I wanted to ensure that the placement rates and employment outcomes that were advertised on ​Code Platoon&#x27;s website were relevant and accurate. The fact that CIRR had consistent reporting with an independent agency allowed me to feel comfortable choosing them among the many bootcamps I could find online.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Jesslyn V</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hactiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">CIRR had a significant influence on my decision (to enroll in Hacktiv8 program). I read the report before enrolling, and the results were convincing enough to give me confidence in the program. Among the data points, employment results and median annual base salary stood out as the most relevant to me. I would certainly recommend others to check CIRR, as it provides factual insights into what they can expect after graduating from the bootcamp.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67d97dc4f2eed921b54b4535_Testimonial%20-%20Nick%20Smith%20-%20Code%20Platoon.jpeg" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Beknazar Zhumabaev</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">I looked at a lot of coding bootcamp options. Code Platoon stood out for many reasons, including their transparency regarding their job placement outcomes, and their participation in CIRR, and that ultimately helped me choose Code Platoon.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="logo-container"><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdcf300626b3c2a9523bd_home_01.jpg" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Megan Kaba</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Codesmith (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">Seeking transparency with bootcamps at the outset moving forward, I looked for those who disclosed their graduate outcomes and discovered CIRR. The CIRR reports presented all the data I needed to know to feel confident about selecting a bootcamp. Ultimately, I chose my software engineering program based on the data from CIRR and the program&#x27;s rigorous admissions process.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Achmad R.</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hacktiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">I believe CIRR has a considerable impact, as Hacktiv8 remains competitive despite increasing market competition. Providing transparent graduation data is essential, especially for a long-standing coding bootcamp like Hacktiv8. Transparency is key to maintaining credibility and standing out in the industry. Among the CIRR data points, I find the time it takes for graduates to secure jobs to be the most critical, as fresh graduates and career switchers need to know how soon they can gain work experience. If someone is considering a bootcamp, I would definitely recommend Hacktiv8, as it has had a positive impact on my career so far.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdeba9b90fb8eb3b83835_67cec7a4e9d311047dc4b1c8_Testimonial%20-%20Jonathan%20Zayas_Code%20Platoon.png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Jonathan Zayas</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">Being able to see the placement outcomes of coding bootcamps had a strong impact on my decision. Code Platoon’s commitment to transparency, particularly through reporting their outcomes to CIRR, gave me confidence in their ability to support graduates in finding jobs. Seeing clear data on employment rates and salaries helped me compare programs objectively and ultimately reinforced my decision to choose Code Platoon.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdea1d8b5d76c37ac859c_67cec7a4d460f904cf7aff84_Testimonial%20-%20Andrew%20Wicker%20-%20Codesmith.png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Andrew Wicker</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Codesmith (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">The CIRR reports gave me the assurance that I wasn&#x27;t just buying into promises and marketing but investing in a program that had a proven track record. After graduating from Codesmith, and landing a position with a software company leading their field, I&#x27;m grateful that I was able to find and review the information provided through CIRR. Perhaps more importantly, I&#x27;m grateful I was able to rely on it.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Ninda R.</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hacktiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">The transparency in CIRR’s graduate outcomes report significantly influenced my decision to enroll. Having access to verified placement data provided me with confidence in the program. The key factors I considered were the placement rate and the time it took for graduates to secure jobs. Since the average time was around three months, it reassured me before joining. CIRR data is an important consideration for any bootcamp, as it helps prospective students make informed decisions.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67d97dc4f2eed921b54b4535_Testimonial%20-%20Nick%20Smith%20-%20Code%20Platoon.jpeg" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Nick Smith</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">When I was looking into various coding bootcamps, I wanted to ensure that the placement rates and employment outcomes that were advertised on ​Code Platoon&#x27;s website were relevant and accurate. The fact that CIRR had consistent reporting with an independent agency allowed me to feel comfortable choosing them among the many bootcamps I could find online.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdd78a16df6a9f8f39e0c_67d97dc48cfa01316e0645d6_Hactiv8%20Logo%20(1).png" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Jesslyn V</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Hactiv8 (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">CIRR had a significant influence on my decision (to enroll in Hacktiv8 program). I read the report before enrolling, and the results were convincing enough to give me confidence in the program. Among the data points, employment results and median annual base salary stood out as the most relevant to me. I would certainly recommend others to check CIRR, as it provides factual insights into what they can expect after graduating from the bootcamp.</p></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-v3-card"><div><div class="testimonials-author-v2"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67d97dc4f2eed921b54b4535_Testimonial%20-%20Nick%20Smith%20-%20Code%20Platoon.jpeg" alt="" class="testimonials-author-image"/><div><div class="text-size-regular">Beknazar Zhumabaev</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-regular"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-secondary">Code Platoon (grad)</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-border"></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc608133ca59b93079_%E2%80%9C.svg" loading="eager" alt=""/><div class="spacer-small"></div><div><p class="text-color-secondary">I looked at a lot of coding bootcamp options. Code Platoon stood out for many reasons, including their transparency regarding their job placement outcomes, and their participation in CIRR, and that ultimately helped me choose Code Platoon.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section---cta"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="cta-grid-wrap"><div data-w-id="05f626e1-c1e0-e1dd-0a08-10a3188868ba" style="opacity:0"><div class="max-width-medium"><h1 class="heading-style-h1 is-white">Explore our school reports</h1></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="max-width-medium"><p class="text-size-medium">Simple, complete, and comparable outcomes report, publicly available.</p></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="button-group"><a data-wf--button--variant="base" href="/schooldata" class="button w-inline-block"><div>Check our data</div></a></div></div><div data-w-id="05f626e1-c1e0-e1dd-0a08-10a3188868cb" style="opacity:0" class="home-hero-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdcf300626b3c2a9523bd_home_01.jpg" loading="eager" alt="" class="cta-image"/><div class="overlay_card_small"><div class="div-block-4"><h3 class="text-size-regular is-white">2025 Report</h3><div class="div-block-3"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67c764002ea69f7b3c0f367f_cirr_iconsArtboard%201%20copy%2033.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-cta"><div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large"><div class="cta-grid"><div data-w-id="02495349-f691-04f0-1f08-2f90431da9de" class="cta-div"><div><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Choose confidence in your education</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><p>Make informed decisions about your future with verified data on graduation rates, job placements, and salaries. Invest in a program you can trust.</p></div></div><div><a data-wf--button--variant="secondary" href="/for-students" class="button w-variant-b090402a-55bc-a88c-0b0b-a52edf23a4ff w-inline-block"><div>Explore CIRR-verified programs</div></a></div></div><div data-w-id="02495349-f691-04f0-1f08-2f90431da9ea" class="cta-div white"><div><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Elevate your program with transparency</h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div><p>CIRR membership showcases your program’s verified outcomes and builds trust with students. Let your data speak for your success.</p></div></div><div><a data-wf--button--variant="secondary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdtxjWqnO4iVJLJR0JV6cFh8AeZfxw5Luew7mPunJmDQ3YsdQ/viewform" target="_blank" class="button w-variant-b090402a-55bc-a88c-0b0b-a52edf23a4ff w-inline-block"><div>Become a CIRR Member</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><section class="section_cta_final"><div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large"><div data-w-id="d7408a32-43ec-fda3-3c95-8aaf8a32bde5" class="cta_wrap"><div class="cta_content-wrap"><div class="cta_title-wrap"><div class="heading-style-h1">Ready to get <span class="text-span-2">started?</span></div></div><div class="cta_text-wrap"><p>Explore our comprehensive standards and see how CIRR can help you set the benchmark for transparency and success in tech education.</p></div><div class="div-block-10"><a data-wf--button--variant="base" href="/our-standards" class="button w-inline-block"><div>Check our standards</div></a><a href="mailto:info@cirr.org" class="button secondary w-inline-block"><div>Get in touch</div></a></div></div><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(0, 0, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(0, 0, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(0, 0, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(0, 0, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" class="cta_icon-wrap1"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/684fdcf32e5a792140c45d41_footer_67c76524b5d16d0d1fcfd345_pexels-olia-danilevich-4974915.jpg" alt="" class="cta_icon-1"/></div><div class="cta_icon-wrap2 istrnas"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67b5d6cb608133ca59b92fa6/67b5d6cc60813